{
 "name": "termite_mound",
 "description": "African termite mound, the mamba's home: squat lumpy red-brown clay dome (#b5653a, darker #8a4a2a shaded left side, lighter sunlit right side) with a tall turret at the back left and a short turret at the right, clay texture strokes, runnels and pebbles. Rounded, nearly flat top platform about 160 wide at y -480 (x -80..+80) for a coiled snake or doug_cap (y -510). Dark doorway hole at the base centred (0,-70), 120 x 90, near-black #1a0f0a inside a clay lip. Mid tones only (reads on #0b0f14). Anchor bottom-centre (ground y 0); bbox x -222..+222, y -522..0.",
